# q1_dirsearch
Task 1.1  one flat directory versus a directory tree
students in the directory : 12000
look-ups performed        : 2000 each

flat directory (unordered, linear scan)
  comparisons per look-up : 6009.5
  mean look-up time       : 23.180 us
  total for 2000 searches : 46.36 ms
  found                   : 2000

three-level tree (dept / year / student, indexed leaf)
  comparisons per look-up : 10.6
  mean look-up time       : 0.326 us
  total for 2000 searches : 0.65 ms
  found                   : 2000

speed-up of the tree    : 71.2x
comparison ratio        : 565.3x fewer name comparisons
